	"description": "Verbatim transcription of the batch 9 BTF campaign: three SCB 500t/500m3 blueprints flown between Antares Station and nine planets across eight systems, both directions on the Antares pairs. Distances in km, durations in seconds (parsed from the panel's h/m/s strings), damage in PERCENT, fuel in units. Every leg is exactly as the panel printed it; everything derived from it lives in shipping-calibration.md section 11, not here.",
